====Antonyms====
* {{sense|existing as an accident}} {{l|en|inevitable}}, {{l|en|necessary}}, {{l|en|impossible}}; See also [[Thesaurus:inevitable]]
* {{sense|occurring by chance}} {{l|en|inevitable}}, {{l|en|intentional}}; See also [[Thesaurus:intentional]]

